[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_SILO_INSPECTION]
Fire Safety Inspection

[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_SILO_INSPECTION_desc]
“Hey you, the one who spent public funds on a field trip to the Endless Forest, learn from him! See how his plan solved two problems at once? He not only completed the goal, but also helped the Empire get rid of the excess fuel that was induced to purchase... Emmm, that was overstocked due to strategic needs. Learn from him! Where is he now? I want to reward him, now!”\n“Ah, you are here! The Empire thanks you for your dedication. I have decided to reward you with this bottle of sleep-inducing perfume. Oh? Is there anything else you need? Don’t be shy, speak boldly! Rest assured, the Empire will fully support you!”\n“I thought it was something big, but all you wanted was a few boxes of cigarettes. Although the Empire is regulating tobacco, for a hero like you, no problem, no problem! I’ll call the guards to deliver them to you. Keep up the good work! The Empire needs more geniuses like you...”\n\n“Wait what? What do you mean flammable and explosive? WHAAAT? Why didn’t you say that earlier! Quickly, call that chain smoker back, and take that perfume back! Hurry, hurry, hurry!”

